OL,3,ASpain train disaster clouds Sanchez
OL,4,Achances of re-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it is also a national disaster that
OL,7,Fhas shattered confidence in the
OL,8,Fcountry's rail network and the
OL,9,FSocialist-led government of Pedro
OL,10,FSanchez. It is playing out just weeks
OL,11,Fbefore the snap general election he
OL,12,Fcalled.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
